2. Model weights and tokenizers
-------------------------------

The repository has no model weights and no tokenizer files. scripts/convert.py and
scripts/convert_tokenizer.py make the files that the program reads from a model of Hugging Face.
Each model has its own license, on its model card. The tests make tiny random models with
scripts/make_tiny_model.py and scripts/make_tiny_tokenizer.py.
